  "configuration_id": "config_004",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence is for RNA-only scvi_n200 multiprofile models (config_006: 0.6530 accuracy, 0.6283 F1; config_005: 0.6501 accuracy, 0.6275 F1), and multiprofile already helped for PCA (config_002 vs config_001). However, it is unclear whether the best RNA encoder, scvi_n200, also depends on multiprofile aggregation or can perform well with a simpler single-profile setup. config_004 tests scvi_n200 singleprofile, isolating the profile-setting effect while keeping the encoder fixed and avoiding simultaneous changes to image or fusion. This is the best next experiment because it reduces uncertainty about a core design choice, may reveal a simpler strong baseline, and is more informative than jumping directly to multimodal configurations."
}

